  "plan": "Use stat -f / to get exact available bytes. Check sizes of /var/lib/apt/lists and /var/cache to find reclaimable space. The package lists downloaded by apt-get update are large and can be cleared after we know we can install. I'll also consider removing the apt lists to reclaim space.",
